      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC4793218::page::003"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Lowering the structural transition temperature into the relevant Curie-temperature region produces magnetostructural coupling between phases with different magnetizations.",
